Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, thus, a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.48,0:00:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail a brand new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.72,0:00:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.10,0:00:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,On your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.78,0:00:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come above the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth, a legendary. Hooray.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.08,0:00:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll make some waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.88,0:01:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.48,0:01:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And freedom is the only rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.76,0:01:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put it be so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I could burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.24,0:01:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.98,0:01:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing, filled with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.50,0:01:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling\Nalive, but I'll be loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.64,0:01:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.94,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day, I'd make my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.16,0:02:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through,\Nit's a wave in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The world I'm feeling\Nalive, look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.62,0:02:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.68,0:02:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.54,0:02:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.92,0:02:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's about to blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.54,0:02:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull back, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll live to plunder\Nanother day! Yeah, roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't gotta ask me twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.70,0:02:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Antelope, Baratie, draw the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.72,0:02:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Captain, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.60,0:02:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And the second is my name, and these\Nlong-lost bridges out it later!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.44,0:02:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:03:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I don't know how the Kraken works,\Nbut order him to turn around and haul ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.68,0:03:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sodomy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hauling ass just fine all on his own!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.38,0:03:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're such a giant monster,\Nit's kind of shameful, actually!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.14,0:03:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.26,0:03:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I would be doing the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He runs terribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.28,0:03:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather be clumsy and alive\Nthan graceful and dead. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see lava.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.28,0:03:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Evacuate to the front of the ship. Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not going to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a couple of feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.10,0:03:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you've got your lava, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting hotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.22,0:04:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody told me we could\Nbe boiled alive down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.46,0:04:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The ocean sure hates us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a good or bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster. You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The temperature change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's causing a vortex in the current.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Which direction is Fishman Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.62,0:04:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't lose our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.42,0:04:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not ready for real world yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.46,0:04:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.30,0:04:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now jump into the trench.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.14,0:04:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a place you jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.08,0:04:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an abyss!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.06,0:04:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.97,0:04:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something to blackness down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.86,0:05:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Fish people live there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.74,0:05:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Lava!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.65,0:05:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's lava behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And the void in front of us! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we go up? Up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.94,0:05:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's that burning and dark\Nand everything wants to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're being really gloomy, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're some evil demon who looks like him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.04,0:05:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and wants to drag us\Nto the depths of hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.60,0:05:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.98,0:05:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Zootaman!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.66,0:05:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's erupting again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.70,0:05:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look above us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.02,0:05:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's coming down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Baldur's?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.21,0:05:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A mudslide?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an avalanche! Brace yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.34,0:05:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The eruption knocked the rocks loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If one of those hits us,\Nthen the sun is done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Judge the Baldur's, so do me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:05:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go cut them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, hold onto my leg, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.36,0:06:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Zara, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.00,0:06:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let him go, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship is over 8,000\Nmeters deep right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind the boulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go outside or the water\Npressure will crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, but we gotta do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Special Attack: Green Star Sargasso!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.80,0:06:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Usa made seaweed appear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It stopped the boulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's handy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.11,0:06:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow! Nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.14,0:06:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't hold for very long, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.76,0:06:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get moving, Tsurume! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.60,0:06:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster plants? Oh, man! That's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what else you have\Nin that big bag of tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.18,0:07:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're in the clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You were pretty great\Ntoo, Sudamane! Sudamane!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.38,0:07:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sudamane!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.10,0:07:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't we alive or dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.78,0:07:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's light, but we're\Nso deep in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.36,0:07:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.46,0:07:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got stars in my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.54,0:07:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather, just stars, they're in the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, check it out over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.40,0:08:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see anything, it's too bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Nami, tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, there's no doubt about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.98,0:08:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The needle is pointing straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.98,0:08:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.68,0:08:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in a giant bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.38,0:08:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like they have clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The New World is next!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.82,0:08:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.94,0:08:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.28,0:08:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The moron survived!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.78,0:08:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, this is\Nwhere the mermaids live!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Real life!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.12,0:08:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.60,0:08:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream can finally come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How I've longed to see their faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.54,0:08:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To touch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not ready for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't even think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.44,0:09:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.86,0:09:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought my treatment would do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's your dream, but you're\Nnot healthy enough for mermaids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.74,0:09:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.65,0:09:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,For him, this is a fate worse than death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be something you can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If he sees mermaids, it will be death!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.62,0:09:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Saji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to live in\Na world without dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.42,0:09:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die there and\Nget some hot mermaid tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.00,0:09:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who needs blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.78,0:09:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I have lust to sustain me! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's let your rebirth bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.84,0:09:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.74,0:09:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet they fry up all kinds of\Nyummy deep-sea monsters down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wipe up that drool\Nand tell City Mae to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an entrance around here\Nsomewhere, and we've got to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.10,0:10:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, we got company!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap. That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.56,0:10:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And now we're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.98,0:10:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, they look tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.62,0:10:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I want one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.06,0:10:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you allow these foolish\Nhumors to tell you what to do? Crack in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck, Tsutamae?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.58,0:10:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, we were almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:11:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are the Straw\NHat Pirates, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You have quite the\Nreputation for starters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the ones who ruined\Nthe Arlong pirate's plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.24,0:11:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That part makes sense at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.56,0:11:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But for some reason two\Nyears back when Hachi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,was in trouble you stood\Nup for your old enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.92,0:11:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And then you clocked one of the\Ncelestial dragons right in his ugly face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fisher tiger happened to\Ndo the exact same thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.86,0:11:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's the hero of this entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.20,0:11:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Fisher tiger?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.62,0:11:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell it to me straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.10,0:11:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you supposed to be our enemies or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.74,0:11:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I give you an\Noption? Enlist under our
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,banner as members of\Nthe new fishman pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.82,0:11:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else or else meaning\Nwe sink you right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.86,0:12:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What you say fuel up Franky hurry huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I both know that luffy isn't\Ngoing to cooperate with these guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.12,0:12:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're 10 000 meters underwater\Nright now and if we try to fight them
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,we don't stand a chance of winning\Nespecially not with those sea monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So we have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to use all of the\Noxygen we have to make a giant
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido burst so we can charge\Nstraight into fishman island!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.66,0:12:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.56,0:12:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come way too far to die here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree it's risky but it's likely\Nour only chance at surviving this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.08,0:12:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case I'm gonna\Nfill it up right away! Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.12,0:12:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Steer the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's gonna be just super!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So, have you decided if you want to\Nbe part of our crew, Straw Hat Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right, you wish! Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.80,0:12:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You did hear me say what will\Nhappen if you refuse, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.34,0:13:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you are the enemy of the fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing but filthy human scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,that's
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.78,0:13:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,a real shame you won't be seeing
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Fish Man Island after all see Lion
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.66,0:13:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,all right filled up and ready to move
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, we got our own life!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can fight some\Nother time, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.94,0:13:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To the burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.86,0:13:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no more air!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.20,0:14:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting squeezed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.58,0:14:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make it no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.14,0:14:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.02,0:14:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with that crazy ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.24,0:14:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be with you soon, beautiful mermaid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.42,0:14:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost the coning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.18,0:14:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It got stuck when we crossed the bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.08,0:14:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This bubble, it's a double structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.30,0:14:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A normal ship would crash\Nbecause there's nothing but air.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about to run into another bubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Water?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.70,0:15:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This current is really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.14,0:15:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.98,0:15:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Four of us can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.30,0:15:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.34,0:15:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nani! Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.24,0:15:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.15,0:15:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't resist the current!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.90,0:15:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one way to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.76,0:15:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty reckless, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.74,0:16:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we could still go in after\Nthem if you want to, Hammond.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No way to know if they're\Nalive or dead, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.24,0:16:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's track them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.04,0:16:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let Neptune's army get their\Nhands on them first, now can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But before we do anything, we should go\Nback to Noah and tell the boss what's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.74,0:16:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he'd want to know that the\Nman who ruined Arlong's plan is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.52,0:16:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.80,0:16:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.78,0:16:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.18,0:16:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares if I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.78,0:16:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.20,0:16:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He might have moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.18,0:16:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares if he moved?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.50,0:16:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, he's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.88,0:16:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.42,0:17:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.04,0:17:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So how are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.18,0:17:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kuma, you've got so lovely?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.32,0:17:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.22,0:17:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, if Kami's here, we\Nmade it to Fishman Island after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we did!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.06,0:17:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,we were about to drown, but then we\Nwere rescued by a bunch of mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.68,0:17:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.64,0:17:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji Chopper and I just\Nwoke up a few minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.34,0:17:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we're pretty lucky, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.92,0:17:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky enough to wake up in Kami's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, catch. Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.94,0:17:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.99,0:17:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I was supposed to\Npick you guys up on Sabo Odi,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but I was thinking that\Nwas another month from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.70,0:17:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.48,0:18:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, it looks like we got separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, I hope they're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.00,0:18:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So they're lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure it'll turn out okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Bonehead can't do much underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Robot and Mosshead are probably\Nwith them, so I wouldn't worry. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.82,0:18:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything will be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I get to see them again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.46,0:18:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.96,0:18:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're all freezing, so I made\Nsome soup that'll warm you right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.26,0:18:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.70,0:18:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Cold seaweed soup! It's yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.14,0:18:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.14,0:18:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.05,0:18:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you supposed to get\Nbored if the soup is cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.46,0:18:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm such a failure!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The soup is great, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm warmer already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let me try some too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.20,0:19:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your clothes are dry, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they're not dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.74,0:19:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your clothes might be dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.50,0:19:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares if they're dry?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep care of our clothes too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.26,0:19:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.66,0:19:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are those little guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.00,0:19:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's some friends of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.10,0:19:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Medica Mermaid Quintuplets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Ichka, I'm Nika, I'm Sanka,\NI'm Young, and I'm Young too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, why are there two Yonkas?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.54,0:19:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They're really fast swimmers\Nand pretty clever as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.60,0:19:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.51,0:19:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a lot of neat\Nfriends here, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the seafloor of the Mermaid Cove,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.48,0:19:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,home to the girls' dorm of\Nthe famous Mermaid Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.62,0:19:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.53,0:19:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The girls' dorm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just this cute little\Ncafe where I work as a waitress.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.28,0:19:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a lot of pretty\Nmermaids there on staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.28,0:19:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't die! No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I swore I made a promise to myself that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.44,0:20:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,for the entire time I\Nwas on Fishman Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't get a nosebleed and pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've held out for this long,\Nso I deserve a reward, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.54,0:20:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we go up there now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.54,0:20:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll introduce you to all of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.76,0:20:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, a turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.72,0:20:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea turtle elevator, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.78,0:20:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you give us a lift, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.62,0:20:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.36,0:20:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a coral apartment complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.90,0:20:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The dorms are at the very\Nbottom, so rent's cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.34,0:20:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The top floor is the most expensive\Nbecause it gets natural light.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.86,0:20:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.77,0:20:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you're poor?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about Hachi and Papagu?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.56,0:20:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hatchan got beat up real\Nbad about a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:20:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I heard about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.08,0:21:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He was protecting the sunny\Nforest back on Sabaody, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hatchan came from the Fishman District,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.00,0:21:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,so that's where he's been\Nresting and recovering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.06,0:21:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't had the chance\Nto see him lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but from what I hear, he's\Ngetting better all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.10,0:21:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? He's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.34,0:21:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's kind of\Na rough part of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you guys go along with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.58,0:21:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind heading over\Nthere to visit him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.60,0:21:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to\Nthank him face to face!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.86,0:21:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And, well, as for Papa Goo, he's\Na super famous fashion designer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.54,0:21:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So he lives in a big, fancy mansion in the\Nhigh-class district of Fishfrily Hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.36,0:21:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to deliver\Nsome clams over there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, he's your pet, but you two\Ndon't live in the same place?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.46,0:21:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, cause that area is a\Nlittle out of my price range.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.60,0:21:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We have better clams here anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.55,0:21:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that drinking\Nstraw looking tube, Dial?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.60,0:21:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.28,0:21:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the water road. The\Nbubble craftsman built it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.16,0:22:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And when mermaids or fish\Nget inside it, well, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.80,0:22:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.02,0:22:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the surface!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.76,0:22:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it! Luigi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.40,0:22:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.44,0:22:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm swimming in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.88,0:22:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.06,0:22:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're underwater, why do\Nwe see a sky full of clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.54,0:22:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kuma! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.02,0:22:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.42,0:22:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's that coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.54,0:22:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.70,0:22:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these your pirate friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.42,0:22:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that means they\Ndidn't drown after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.10,0:22:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't come in through the\Nentrance like you're supposed to,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.98,0:22:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,so we were concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.38,0:22:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hi there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.48,0:22:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not as scary as I thought you'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.86,0:22:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So you broke in?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.16,0:22:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.40,0:22:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of have a thing for pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.98,0:23:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a real-life fairy tale!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.54,0:23:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A coral paradise!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.94,0:23:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole cone full of mermaids!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.38,0:23:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with Sanji now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.66,0:23:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't even cry this hard\Nwhen he left the Breath egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.70,0:23:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.20,0:23:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I found my all-blue after all these years!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.68,0:23:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.54,0:23:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, let me introduce everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.98,0:23:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Luffy-chin, he's the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.50,0:23:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.50,0:23:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sachi-Chin's the crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.24,0:23:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The nose guy is Usopp. Chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.48,0:23:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.76,0:23:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And the raccoon is Chopper. Chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.30,0:23:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.94,0:23:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.26,0:23:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.78,0:23:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's dance in the water together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.82,0:23:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.06,0:24:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is obviously too good to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.46,0:24:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm destined to die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.06,0:24:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.28,0:24:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck happened to you in the\Nlast two years to make you this gloomy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.88,0:24:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this supposed to be\Nthe land of your dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.58,0:24:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You crack me up, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.00,0:24:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he's joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.26,0:24:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.17,0:24:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,that barrel over there is the one that\Ndrifted in with all Kamey's friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.26,0:24:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.42,0:24:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.00,0:24:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.68,0:24:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sealed pretty tightly,\Nso it's got to be important.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.76,0:24:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.67,0:24:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we should open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.38,0:24:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.28,0:24:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So Straw Hat finally made\Nit to our turf, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.86,0:24:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.84,0:24:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.20,0:24:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do about it, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.68,0:24:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to bring him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.82,0:24:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And quickly.
